        "Title": "The Corrupted",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN_EBOLA",
        "PublicId": "115379689077",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/scene_ebola.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c69d9281-28cd-4aeb-a4f4-ab1e8b25c823).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47,\r\rYour target is Salvatore Bravuomo, notorious business mogul, and the current mayor of Sapienza. Bravuomo is awaiting confirmation from two ex-MI6 agents, who are giving him instructions on how to rig the ballot box before his next election in return for several thousand dollars. Our client wants to ensure that his town is in non-corrupted hands, so this cannot come to commence.  \r\rEliminate Bravuomo, his two bodyguards, and the rogue agents.\r\rHappy hunting, 47.",
